WEBVTT

00:02:28.496 --> 00:02:30.371
you can still change your environment

00:02:30.371 --> 00:02:33.913
by making as many speed bumps as you can,

00:02:33.954 --> 00:02:36.121
to slow down the pace of purchases.

00:02:36.121 --> 00:02:38.496
Maybe link the app to a debit card

00:02:38.538 --> 00:02:40.746
with a small preset amount of money.

00:02:40.788 --> 00:02:44.121
You can also delete the app
after every purchase,

00:02:44.121 --> 00:02:47.163
so that it's not
enticing you at all hours.

00:02:47.163 --> 00:02:48.621
Now let's talk about shopping.

00:02:48.621 --> 00:02:49.788
Let me be clear:

00:02:49.788 --> 00:02:52.163
I'm not saying that you
should never go shopping.

00:02:52.163 --> 00:02:53.496
What I am saying

00:02:53.496 --> 00:02:57.288
is that I encourage you to buy the things
that bring you happiness.

00:02:57.288 --> 00:03:00.454
